  - Name: Life
    Description: "An organism resembling a larva that is born and grows within every
      conscious being. When it reaches maturity, its host fades away and the creature
      is released, drifting into the sky \u2014 toward a destination no one has ever
      truly understood."
    ShortDescription: An organism resembling a larva with angel wings that is born
      and grows within every conscious being.
    GamePlayDescription: Gain 1 UP
    SmallIcon: {fileID: -3359916698839239071, guid: 38b03507853ec41159ccd0fb7372e192, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: -3359916698839239071, guid: 38b03507853ec41159ccd0fb7372e192, type: 3}
