    associatedEssence: 0
  - Name: Premature Life
    Description: "An organism resembling a larva that is born and grows within every
      conscious being. Premature lives, also called \"wingless lifes\", are forced
      out when their host dies too early. Unable to fly, they cannot reach \u201Cparadise\u201D;
      the discovery of these beings gave rise to the arts of embalming and elevation."
    ShortDescription: An organism resembling a larva that is born and grows within
      every conscious being.
    GamePlayDescription: Sometimes Gain 1 UP
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 8591797986722409971, guid: 1eec7da188d2b4ab2b7fcbd6d70b9c16, type: 3}
